## 00898 PATIENT=1 DOCTOR=2
1: Ah, hello doctor. It's this cough of mine, it's been going on forever. Six weeks, near enough. ~ cc s1
2: Six weeks is a long time, you were right to come. Is it a dry cough or are you bringing anything up? ~ s1
1: Dry, dry as a bone. Nothing comes up at all. ~ s1
2: Is it worse at any time of day? ~ s1
1: At night, mostly. It tickles in my throat when I lie down. ~ s1
2: Have you had any fever, or been coughing up blood? ~ n1
1: No fever, no blood, thank God. ~ n1
2: And what tablets are you on at the moment? ~ m1
1: Ramipril, 5 mg, once a day, for the blood pressure. ~ m1
2: Thank you. You mentioned blood pressure, is that the only long-term problem? ~ h1
1: That's the one. Blood pressure, for about eight years. ~ h1
2: Are you a smoker? ~ so1
1: I was, and I still have the odd one if I'm out with the girls. ~ so1
2: Roughly how many would you have in a week? ~ so1
1: Och, not many. Five, maybe six. ~ so1
2: I see. And has the cough been interfering with your sleep? ~
1: It has, yes. My husband has moved into the spare room. ~
2: That sounds miserable for both of you. Let me listen to your chest for a moment. ~
1: Go on. ~ pause=14
2: I'll arrange a chest X-ray, just to be sure there's nothing in the lungs that I can't hear. ~ p1
1: Will that take long? ~
2: It's very quick. You can have it done at the hospital this week, no appointment needed. ~
1: That's grand. And what about the cough itself? ~
2: There is a possibility that the ramipril is causing it, because dry coughs are a known side effect, but we should check the X-ray first. ~ d1
1: I never knew that. ~
2: Many people don't. Please don't stop it by yourself, we'll talk after the X-ray. ~ c1
1: I won't, I promise. ~
2: Would you like to talk about cutting down on the smoking at the same time? ~
1: Not today, doctor, if you don't mind. ~
2: That's fine. The offer is there whenever you want it. ~
1: Thank you. You're very kind. ~
2: If you start coughing up blood, or get breathless, come back straight away. ~ c2
1: I will, I will. ~
@@
